<title>UK: Airtours, Carnival Corp launch Costa tender.</title>
<headline>Airtours, Carnival Corp launch Costa tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British holiday company Airtours Plc said on Monday that with U.S. partner Carnival Corp it had launched a tender offer for Italy's Costa Crociere SpA.</p>
<p>The partners made the move on Saturday after receiving all necessary regulatory and governmental approvals for the deal, Airtours said in a statement.</p>
</text>
